:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the Enemy Unit, see [[Katsumi Orochi (Enemy)]].''
'''Katsumi Orochi''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 792
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Katsumi Orochi
|name2 = Katsumi Orochi CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Katsumi Orochi CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
A very simple [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Red]]/[[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Alien]] nuker, equipped with [[Barrier Breaker]]. Katsumi functions adequately at his intended role; his quick attack rate makes him especially useful against [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]], specifically as a counter to [[UltraBaaBaa]]. He has a high enough standing range to counter most relevant threats, and his blazing fast foreswing almost guarantees his attacks always land. However, Katsumi lacks any relevant immunities and has terrible HP, so be sure to protect him well.

{{Job|Classification = Nuker}}

