==Trivia==
*Katsumi Orochi's description used to state that he pierces "[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] [[Barrier]]s", yet all [[:Category:Enemies with Barriers|enemies with Barriers]] are [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]], not Aku. This may be because the translators conflated him with the previous unit, [[Kaoru Hanayama (Uber Rare Cat)|Kaoru Hanayama]], who pierces Aku [[Shield]]s. This error was later fixed.

